WEBVTT

00:00:14.227 --> 00:00:19.733
<i>What's this feeling I have,</i>
<i>as if I'm looking forward to...</i>

00:00:19.733 --> 00:00:25.939
<i>... somebody firing off his</i>
<i>missiles and ending everything?</i>

00:00:25.939 --> 00:00:31.378
<i>Is it a bad thing, or is this normal?</i>

00:00:31.378 --> 00:00:37.884
<i>I can't figure it out on my</i>
<i>own, so somebody tell me!</i>

00:00:37.884 --> 00:00:43.490
<i>And that person I love has once again...</i>

00:00:43.490 --> 00:00:49.930
<i>... gone far away without anybody noticing.</i>

00:00:49.930 --> 00:00:56.103
<i>Where have my dreams gone since then?</i>

00:00:56.103 --> 00:01:01.775
<i>I could swear that they</i>
<i>were right here long ago.</i>

00:01:01.775 --> 00:01:07.814
<i>We had a love that set our hearts on fire.</i>

00:01:07.814 --> 00:01:20.784
<i>Let's take back that feeling we had back then!</i>

00:01:33.673 --> 00:01:35.776
Ryoko!

00:01:35.776 --> 00:01:37.210
I don't have any!

00:01:37.210 --> 00:01:39.913
You're not gonna chip in this month, either?

00:01:39.913 --> 00:01:42.682
C'mon, Ryoko!

00:01:42.682 --> 00:01:45.185
If I can't pay, I can't pay!

00:01:45.185 --> 00:01:47.254
Darn it, Ryoko!

00:01:47.254 --> 00:01:49.289
Hey, I'm a space pirate!

00:01:49.289 --> 00:01:52.159
I take money, I don't give it away!

00:01:52.159 --> 00:01:54.923
You understand, right?

00:01:57.898 --> 00:01:59.923
Let's go, Ryo-Ohki.

00:02:04.304 --> 00:02:07.671
No, we can't tell on her to Tenchi.

00:02:10.644 --> 00:02:12.111
Aw, hell.

00:02:17.684 --> 00:02:18.651
Money.

00:02:23.824 --> 00:02:25.959
We're sorry! We're sorry!
We're sorry! We're sorry!

00:02:25.959 --> 00:02:30.831
Just give us 'til next week.
No, we'll pay you in three days!

00:02:30.831 --> 00:02:32.699
You can't pay this month, either?

00:02:32.699 --> 00:02:36.770
Could you chip in a little? Anything at all?

00:02:36.770 --> 00:02:39.000
Please!

00:02:41.041 --> 00:02:43.343
Please!

00:02:43.343 --> 00:02:47.247
Well, if they can't pay, they can't pay.

00:02:47.247 --> 00:02:49.916
Thank you, Sasami!

00:02:49.916 --> 00:02:52.407
Thank you so much!

00:02:54.154 --> 00:02:57.257
I guess I'll go start lunch or something.

00:02:57.257 --> 00:02:58.918
Let's go, Ryo-Ohki.

00:03:01.595 --> 00:03:03.797
What're we gonna do
after tomorrow, Ryo-Ohki?

00:03:03.797 --> 00:03:06.199
The food budget is the last
thing I can still cut back on...

00:03:06.199 --> 00:03:09.035
I guess everyone will have to go
without lunch starting tomorrow.

00:03:09.035 --> 00:03:12.239
I'm sorry, Ryo-Ohki.
Just try to make the best of it.

00:03:12.239 --> 00:03:13.729
Right...

00:03:14.674 --> 00:03:19.012
So what it all boils down to is money!

00:03:19.012 --> 00:03:20.479
Fight!

00:03:21.615 --> 00:03:26.653
Lt'll be all right, Sasami.
Just leave everything to me.

00:03:26.653 --> 00:03:31.681
It's my duty as future wife of the Masaki
household to save the family finances!

00:03:32.325 --> 00:03:35.726
Good wives come to those who wait!

00:03:39.599 --> 00:03:42.864
Ow...

00:03:45.939 --> 00:03:47.270
Money.

00:03:48.842 --> 00:03:52.279
And so, we're going off to Tokyo.

00:03:52.279 --> 00:03:53.413
What for?

00:03:53.413 --> 00:03:54.848
To work, of course!

00:03:54.848 --> 00:03:56.249
We'll go there and make some money!

00:03:56.249 --> 00:03:57.684
Just leave it to us!

00:03:57.684 --> 00:03:59.419
We're gonna make a bundle!

00:03:59.419 --> 00:04:00.587
Yeah!

00:04:00.587 --> 00:04:03.223
Tokyo, Tokyo! Yeah, yeah!

00:04:03.223 --> 00:04:04.491
Get rich quick!

00:04:04.491 --> 00:04:08.621
But wouldn't round-trip tickets cost
way more than what I was asking for?

00:04:13.767 --> 00:04:17.637
Everything in that land is yours.

00:04:17.637 --> 00:04:21.741
Is there something that you want, Yugi?

00:04:21.741 --> 00:04:23.436
A castle.

00:04:24.477 --> 00:04:27.207
I want a castle there.

00:04:28.682 --> 00:04:30.479
Okay.

00:04:31.451 --> 00:04:34.621
Tokyo! Tokyo!

00:04:34.621 --> 00:04:36.957
Well, here we are!

00:04:36.957 --> 00:04:38.391
It's Tokyo!

00:04:38.391 --> 00:04:40.393
The bustling metropolis!

00:04:40.393 --> 00:04:42.429
The place to go for part-time jobs!

00:04:42.429 --> 00:04:45.899
And so, let's take a picture! Cheese!

00:04:45.899 --> 00:04:47.467
But Tenchi can't find out about this.

00:04:47.467 --> 00:04:49.869
Given the situation, it can't be helped.

00:04:49.869 --> 00:04:52.429
So let's earn us a bundle!

00:04:54.641 --> 00:04:58.912
Understand, Mihoshi? We're up
against the wall here. We're desperate.

00:04:58.912 --> 00:05:01.881
Kiyone, Kiyone! Let's have
some chilled navel oranges!

00:05:01.881 --> 00:05:04.150
We're not gonna eat any oranges!

00:05:04.150 --> 00:05:08.382
Anyway, whose fault is
it that we're in this mess?!

00:05:09.255 --> 00:05:11.524
Whose?

00:05:11.524 --> 00:05:13.526
You little...

00:05:13.526 --> 00:05:14.728
Look!

00:05:14.728 --> 00:05:19.065
Whose fault is it that they
call us the Part-timers of Death?

00:05:19.065 --> 00:05:21.868
Whose fault is it that the local housewives...

00:05:21.868 --> 00:05:24.337
...and women with kids
snicker when they see us?

00:05:24.337 --> 00:05:27.507
Whose fault is it that we haven't had
anything with our rice this past month?!

00:05:27.507 --> 00:05:30.410
Well? Whose?!

00:05:30.410 --> 00:05:32.345
Whose?

00:05:32.345 --> 00:05:34.836
I'm sorry!

00:05:37.117 --> 00:05:39.152
If you get my point,
try to get your act together!

00:05:39.152 --> 00:05:40.787
Okay!

00:05:40.787 --> 00:05:42.055
Money.

00:05:42.055 --> 00:05:43.657
Without it, you die.

00:05:43.657 --> 00:05:44.891
Let's get to it, Mihoshi!

00:05:44.891 --> 00:05:46.415
- Yeah!
- Yeah!

00:05:49.829 --> 00:05:51.931
I've always wanted to come here.

00:05:51.931 --> 00:05:53.421
Really?

00:05:54.534 --> 00:05:57.337
What say we spend the
day seeing the sights, then?

00:05:57.337 --> 00:05:58.204
Really?

00:05:58.204 --> 00:05:59.694
Yeah.

00:06:01.474 --> 00:06:03.443
Still...

00:06:03.443 --> 00:06:06.776
I keep feeling like we're being watched...

00:06:08.915 --> 00:06:10.984
Well, she is really cute.

00:06:10.984 --> 00:06:14.054
It's no surprise that
people would look at her.

00:06:14.054 --> 00:06:15.355
What is it?

00:06:15.355 --> 00:06:17.424
Uh... Nothing.

00:06:17.424 --> 00:06:19.926
You don't like places like this, Masaki?

00:06:19.926 --> 00:06:21.895
No, that's not it.

00:06:21.895 --> 00:06:26.355
I grew up way out in the
boonies in the mountains, so...

00:06:32.439 --> 00:06:33.973
Hey...

00:06:33.973 --> 00:06:35.600
Wanna go someplace else?

00:06:40.580 --> 00:06:42.912
What the hell?

00:06:46.820 --> 00:06:49.015
Damn phone...

00:06:58.498 --> 00:07:00.329
Moron!

00:07:00.867 --> 00:07:01.101
"Japanese Tea House Chabashira"

00:07:01.101 --> 00:07:02.569
"Japanese Tea House Chabashira"
Welcome!

00:07:02.569 --> 00:07:03.103
Welcome!

00:07:03.103 --> 00:07:05.305
What will your order be?

00:07:05.305 --> 00:07:06.172
Coffee.

00:07:06.172 --> 00:07:09.142
That will be one powdered tea, then.

00:07:09.142 --> 00:07:10.376
No, coffee.

00:07:10.376 --> 00:07:13.146
You seem to be suffering
from a vitamin deficiency,

00:07:13.146 --> 00:07:15.849
and powdered tea is quite good for you.

00:07:15.849 --> 00:07:16.950
Coffee!

00:07:16.950 --> 00:07:18.251
Powdered tea it is.

00:07:18.251 --> 00:07:19.085
Coffee!

00:07:19.085 --> 00:07:21.554
Sir, put on some powdered tea, please!

00:07:21.554 --> 00:07:24.057
I asked for a coffee, you flake!

00:07:24.057 --> 00:07:28.194
What? How rude! I won't stand for it!

00:07:28.194 --> 00:07:31.164
I'm never coming here again! Moron!

00:07:31.164 --> 00:07:34.968
And here I was being nice because
I thought this was a service industry!

00:07:34.968 --> 00:07:37.232
What a horrible customer!

00:07:38.705 --> 00:07:38.738
"Japanese Tea House Chabashira"

00:07:38.738 --> 00:07:40.640
"Japanese Tea House Chabashira"
You pinhead!

00:07:40.640 --> 00:07:41.402
"Japanese Tea House Chabashira"

00:07:47.947 --> 00:07:50.177
What are we gonna do, Mihoshi?

00:07:51.718 --> 00:07:53.119
Well...

00:07:53.119 --> 00:07:55.755
Maybe we can fool 'em if we
plug up the hole in the wall...

00:07:55.755 --> 00:07:58.057
...with this extra-large wok!

00:07:58.057 --> 00:08:00.894
Lt'll never work. They'd spot it right away.

00:08:00.894 --> 00:08:02.953
I guess you're right.

00:08:04.030 --> 00:08:06.055
Get out!

00:08:10.703 --> 00:08:12.967
Money, huh?

00:08:13.907 --> 00:08:17.070
I wonder if everybody's
working hard in Tokyo?

00:08:20.146 --> 00:08:23.013
But we still need money... Money...

00:08:36.563 --> 00:08:39.361
Do your job this time!

00:08:41.234 --> 00:08:45.038
How immature, to make
a fuss over such a trifle...

00:08:45.038 --> 00:08:46.528
What?

00:08:47.574 --> 00:08:49.309
Welcome!

00:08:49.309 --> 00:08:50.844
This place sure seems nice and quiet.

00:08:50.844 --> 00:08:52.334
Yeah.

00:08:53.947 --> 00:08:56.609
Tenchi and Sakuya!

00:09:02.822 --> 00:09:05.391
Talk about your awkward silences...

00:09:05.391 --> 00:09:07.493
Let's see...

00:09:07.493 --> 00:09:09.762
I've gotta talk about something.

00:09:09.762 --> 00:09:12.398
But what? Lemme think...

00:09:12.398 --> 00:09:16.135
The Okayama prefecture ball park?
The Mizushima industrial complex?

00:09:16.135 --> 00:09:17.770
Millet dumplings?

00:09:17.770 --> 00:09:21.137
No! I've gotta think of something!

00:09:23.142 --> 00:09:24.477
What is it?

00:09:24.477 --> 00:09:26.079
I'm just looking at you.

00:09:26.079 --> 00:09:28.248
At me?

00:09:28.248 --> 00:09:30.550
I'm not very interesting.

00:09:30.550 --> 00:09:32.585
I'm not even much of a conversationalist.

00:09:32.585 --> 00:09:34.053
Why?

00:09:34.053 --> 00:09:35.221
What do you mean?

00:09:35.221 --> 00:09:37.790
I'm having fun.

00:09:37.790 --> 00:09:40.393
It's fun, being with you.

00:09:40.393 --> 00:09:41.628
Really?

00:09:41.628 --> 00:09:43.459
Really.

00:09:46.332 --> 00:09:49.702
Congratulations! Congratulations!

00:09:49.702 --> 00:09:53.907
Table 7! We've now begun our
Make-Out Probability Fluctuator!

00:09:53.907 --> 00:09:56.676
Ayeka? What's she doing here?

00:09:56.676 --> 00:09:58.444
Hey! Isn't that...

00:09:58.444 --> 00:09:59.812
Let's go!

00:09:59.812 --> 00:10:01.439
Come on!

00:10:02.815 --> 00:10:05.451
Hey! Get away from Tenchi!

00:10:05.451 --> 00:10:07.720
Can't you hear me?! Hey!

00:10:07.720 --> 00:10:10.086
Get off my back! Let go!

00:10:13.026 --> 00:10:14.827
Man, I'm beat...

00:10:14.827 --> 00:10:17.130
Hasn't anybody dropped a
wallet that's full of 10,000-yen bills,

00:10:17.130 --> 00:10:20.861
or a lottery card that's won
the 100,000,000 yen jackpot?

00:10:24.437 --> 00:10:26.439
Is this a dream? A vision?

00:10:26.439 --> 00:10:29.442
Running into Tenchi
in this desert of Tokyo...

00:10:29.442 --> 00:10:32.309
...makes me believe in the miracle of love!

00:10:34.247 --> 00:10:37.045
It's that floozy!

00:10:38.718 --> 00:10:40.486
Hey, you bimbo!

00:10:40.486 --> 00:10:42.922
Get away from my Tenchi!

00:10:42.922 --> 00:10:43.890
Ryoko!

00:10:43.890 --> 00:10:45.758
That's the lady from...

00:10:45.758 --> 00:10:47.627
Look out!

00:10:47.627 --> 00:10:50.357
Hey! Get away from him!

00:10:57.070 --> 00:11:00.005
Son of a...

00:11:04.444 --> 00:11:06.207
Okay! Balance on the ball!

00:11:08.614 --> 00:11:10.582
Now, jump through the hoop!

00:11:14.520 --> 00:11:16.681
We hit the jackpot, didn't we, Ryo-Ohki?

00:11:18.925 --> 00:11:21.794
I'm sorry, Kiyone.

00:11:21.794 --> 00:11:25.195
We got fired again.

00:11:26.366 --> 00:11:29.301
Come on, cheer up!

00:11:30.470 --> 00:11:32.461
Come on!

00:11:34.574 --> 00:11:36.974
What're we gonna do?

00:11:42.081 --> 00:11:44.777
Kiyone! Kiyone! Look!

00:11:46.986 --> 00:11:47.253
"One million yen per day"

00:11:47.253 --> 00:11:49.322
"One million yen per day"
This is it!

00:11:49.322 --> 00:11:49.845
"One million yen per day"

00:12:09.942 --> 00:12:11.273
"Do Not Enter Due to Construction"

00:12:14.947 --> 00:12:17.583
This is fun! It's like construction work!

00:12:17.583 --> 00:12:20.486
But making a million yen
from this... Something's fishy.

00:12:20.486 --> 00:12:22.789
Who cares? We're making money!

00:12:22.789 --> 00:12:24.090
True, but...

00:12:24.090 --> 00:12:26.615
Don't worry, don't worry!

00:12:27.093 --> 00:12:28.856
Mihoshi!

00:12:30.196 --> 00:12:33.332
Hey, you two slackers!

00:12:33.332 --> 00:12:35.568
I want to see your hands
moving, not your mouths!

00:12:35.568 --> 00:12:38.137
If I see any more loafing, I'll dock your pay!

00:12:38.137 --> 00:12:40.640
Got it? Get to work!

00:12:40.640 --> 00:12:43.242
What's with her?

00:12:43.242 --> 00:12:44.944
She's so mean!

00:12:44.944 --> 00:12:48.314
We just need to put up with it for
one day and we'll have our million.

00:12:48.314 --> 00:12:50.407
Just ignore it. Just keep working.

00:12:51.484 --> 00:12:53.486
You! The loafer there!

00:12:53.486 --> 00:12:55.621
Die on your own time!

00:12:55.621 --> 00:12:57.782
Ayeka!

00:12:58.357 --> 00:13:03.296
Oh, hello! What a coincidence,
meeting you in a place like this.

00:13:03.296 --> 00:13:05.865
This job is a death trap...

00:13:05.865 --> 00:13:09.426
So did you come here after
seeing that flyer, too, Ayeka?

00:13:10.470 --> 00:13:13.962
Oh, I love heights!

00:13:14.707 --> 00:13:16.709
Enough with the chatter! Get to work!

00:13:16.709 --> 00:13:18.744
Get back to work, you two!

00:13:18.744 --> 00:13:19.979
Y-Yes, Ma'am!

00:13:19.979 --> 00:13:22.715
What a hothead!

00:13:22.715 --> 00:13:27.687
Like they say, " Morons
and smoke love heights"...

00:13:27.687 --> 00:13:29.055
What did you say?

00:13:29.055 --> 00:13:32.959
How dare you address the First
Princess of Jurai in such a manner?!

00:13:32.959 --> 00:13:35.661
- Ryoko!
- "There is no cure for stupidity"...

00:13:35.661 --> 00:13:38.931
Huh? What are you doing here?

00:13:38.931 --> 00:13:41.534
Us? What are you doing here?

00:13:41.534 --> 00:13:43.769
This place has the best pay.

00:13:43.769 --> 00:13:47.273
I came here because
this job's pay is the highest.

00:13:47.273 --> 00:13:51.073
- Always copyin' other people...
- She's always copying others...

00:13:51.911 --> 00:13:54.814
That's enough!

00:13:54.814 --> 00:13:58.113
How long are you people going to goof off?!

00:13:59.051 --> 00:14:02.488
Or don't you want that million yen?

00:14:02.488 --> 00:14:02.555
"One Million Yen"
Or don't you want that million yen?

00:14:02.555 --> 00:14:05.490
"One Million Yen"

00:14:08.494 --> 00:14:10.763
A million, a million,
a million, a million, a million...

00:14:10.763 --> 00:14:13.766
A million, a million, a million,
a million, a million, a million...

00:14:13.766 --> 00:14:16.002
A million! A million!

00:14:16.002 --> 00:14:17.731
A million!

00:14:18.571 --> 00:14:20.630
A million!

00:14:35.321 --> 00:14:36.689
Oh, well.

00:14:36.689 --> 00:14:38.124
A million, a million, a million, a million...

00:14:38.124 --> 00:14:39.592
A million, a million, a million, a million...

00:14:39.592 --> 00:14:41.127
A million, a million, a million!

00:14:41.127 --> 00:14:44.864
A million! A million! A million!
A million! A million! A million!

00:14:44.864 --> 00:14:46.566
A million, a million, a million, a million!

00:14:46.566 --> 00:14:48.301
A million, a million,
a million, a million, a million!

00:14:48.301 --> 00:14:51.504
A million!

00:14:51.504 --> 00:14:54.807
Good! It's done!

00:14:54.807 --> 00:14:57.009
Good work, everybody!

00:14:57.009 --> 00:14:58.511
W-We did it!

00:14:58.511 --> 00:15:00.012
It looks like crap...

00:15:00.012 --> 00:15:01.781
My hands are all sticky...

00:15:01.781 --> 00:15:04.016
Anyway, we made our million!

00:15:04.016 --> 00:15:07.042
Bring us our million yen!

00:15:09.455 --> 00:15:11.190
Well done, everyone.

00:15:11.190 --> 00:15:15.494
But the world's gone soft if you
thought this would earn you a million yen.

00:15:15.494 --> 00:15:17.563
What?!

00:15:17.563 --> 00:15:21.133
The real work is just beginning.

00:15:21.133 --> 00:15:22.964
Say what?!

00:15:23.269 --> 00:15:26.239
We have to work some more?!

00:15:26.239 --> 00:15:29.842
Man's boundless desire to
build since the dawn of history

00:15:29.842 --> 00:15:34.380
has now completely manifested
in this giant guardian spirit.

00:15:34.380 --> 00:15:35.615
And its name is...

00:15:35.615 --> 00:15:37.674
Daidarahoshi!

00:15:43.155 --> 00:15:44.690
What the heck is that?

00:15:44.690 --> 00:15:46.988
Just give us our money first!

00:16:16.756 --> 00:16:18.858
Go, Daidarahoshi!

00:16:18.858 --> 00:16:22.123
We will build a palace here!

00:16:46.519 --> 00:16:47.887
Kiyone!

00:16:47.887 --> 00:16:49.588
Hey, Kiyone!

00:16:49.588 --> 00:16:53.859
What about our million yen?

00:16:53.859 --> 00:16:56.987
Hey! Come on, Kiyone!

00:16:58.264 --> 00:17:00.700
What did she think we were?

00:17:00.700 --> 00:17:08.641
We tried... We worked so hard... So hard...

00:17:08.641 --> 00:17:10.905
You have got to be kidding me!

00:17:12.044 --> 00:17:16.315
Galaxy Police, Sol System,
Earth resident officer Kiyone! Let's do it!

00:17:16.315 --> 00:17:18.909
Mihoshi! Ditto! Let's do it!

00:17:23.956 --> 00:17:27.016
Wait for me, Kiyone!

00:17:33.265 --> 00:17:36.302
This is amazing! Talk about elaborate!

00:17:36.302 --> 00:17:38.471
Anyway, let's attack, Mihoshi!

00:17:38.471 --> 00:17:40.132
Right!

00:17:41.207 --> 00:17:44.108
Take this! And this! And this! And this!

00:17:47.113 --> 00:17:49.749
It's not working at all!

00:17:49.749 --> 00:17:51.717
Just keep shooting!

00:17:59.492 --> 00:18:01.260
It's like he's making fun of me!

00:18:01.260 --> 00:18:02.921
Now I'm pissed!

00:18:17.276 --> 00:18:19.111
Ow!

00:18:19.111 --> 00:18:20.780
This guy's a powerhouse...

00:18:20.780 --> 00:18:23.715
Does he have any weak spots?

00:18:27.720 --> 00:18:29.121
What's that?

00:18:29.121 --> 00:18:33.058
Oh, that? I, uh...

00:18:33.058 --> 00:18:37.427
I sorta broke that part.

00:18:39.398 --> 00:18:40.566
Are you serious?

00:18:40.566 --> 00:18:42.268
L-I'm sorry!

00:18:42.268 --> 00:18:44.361
Nice, Mihoshi!

00:18:47.640 --> 00:18:50.666
Take this! And this! And this! And this!

00:18:55.247 --> 00:18:58.410
And this! And this! And this! And this!

00:19:07.193 --> 00:19:09.093
Got him!

00:19:13.632 --> 00:19:16.235
I had a great time today, Masaki.

00:19:16.235 --> 00:19:20.103
I'm beat... Totally wiped out.

00:19:29.782 --> 00:19:32.718
It was crazy, but it was kinda funny...

00:19:32.718 --> 00:19:34.811
Yeah, I guess it was.

00:19:38.624 --> 00:19:40.922
That breeze feels great.

00:19:47.533 --> 00:19:50.001
We should come here again, Masaki!

00:19:51.237 --> 00:19:52.795
Sure!

00:20:04.216 --> 00:20:07.344
We did it! We did it! We did it!

00:20:09.989 --> 00:20:14.326
So how much did we earn?

00:20:14.326 --> 00:20:18.490
Not one red cent, you moron...

00:20:21.033 --> 00:20:24.670
Oh, it was torn down...

00:20:24.670 --> 00:20:26.695
Not bad at all.

00:20:32.211 --> 00:20:35.548
So we gotta hitchhike home?

00:20:35.548 --> 00:20:38.817
So what did we go to Tokyo for?

00:20:38.817 --> 00:20:41.420
With the travel costs and the fact
that we didn't make any money,

00:20:41.420 --> 00:20:43.522
we're so far in the red it's not funny.

00:20:43.522 --> 00:20:48.594
It won't just be no lunches,
we're looking at no breakfast, either!

00:20:48.594 --> 00:20:51.330
But it sure was fun, right? Right?

00:20:51.330 --> 00:20:54.857
The future wife... Part-time job earnings...

00:20:56.502 --> 00:20:58.304
Damn it!

00:20:58.304 --> 00:21:02.074
Anybody! Gimme some money! Please!

00:21:02.074 --> 00:21:03.976
It's a good thing we were
able to make some money!

00:21:03.976 --> 00:21:07.179
I bought a new broom, and
now we have plenty to live on!

00:21:07.179 --> 00:21:09.272
Right, Ryo-Ohki?

