00:22:17.683 --> 00:22:21.787
<i>I just can't stop it, I just can't stop it,</i>

00:22:21.787 --> 00:22:25.057
<i>no matter how old I get!</i>

00:22:25.057 --> 00:22:28.594
<i>I just can't stop it, I just can't stop it,</i>

00:22:28.594 --> 00:22:33.293
<i>even if I die, change shape, or get reborn!</i>

00:22:43.742 --> 00:22:46.812
Hi, everyone! I'm Mihoshi!

00:22:46.812 --> 00:22:51.850
Sasami felt like she was in danger,
so she went to see Tenchi in Tokyo!

00:22:51.850 --> 00:22:55.954
